  (text "GPIO map: GPIO0 BUS_TX (UART0), GPIO1 BUS_RX, GPIO2 BUS_DE, GPIO3/4 BANK_ID0/1, GPIO6-9 MUX_S0-S3,\nGPIO10 LED_DATA, GPIO25 STATUS_LED, GPIO26-29 ADC: KEY_A, KEY_B, DET_A, DET_B. Unused GPIO are flagged no-connect.\nADC_AVDD is on +3.3VA, the same rail as the sensors and muxes, so the ADC reference tracks the ratiometric sensors."
